    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d453">

                <pb facs="0625" n="617" sameAs="frus:frus1941v04/pg617"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/16848</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-11-18">November 18, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chinese Ambassador called at my request and I gave him the substance of my
                    statement to the British Minister a few minutes before,<anchor n="42"
                        xml:id="d453-f1"/> except that I did not refer specifically to the last
                    remarks between me and the Japanese officials about a temporary arrangement such
                    as I described in my talk with the British. This matter was not immediately
                    pertinent to the Chinese angle.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d453-f1" n="42" xml:id="d453-f1-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
